The NSA SELinux testsuite has been ported to LTP and is
available in LTP's 20050707 release. However, some improvements were
made and you will need to download from CVS tree to get these
improvements as the next LTP release is not until August.

I have included in this email an selinux-hooks-testcase-coverage matrix,
which is in openoffice format. Take a look and if you are interested in
helping too implement more testcases, it would be greatly appreciated.

Regards,
Joy Latten





